    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible-light photoredox-catalyzed reductive dearomative arylcarboxylation of indoles using CO2 and aryl halides. This strategy utilizes a successive single-electron transfer (SSET) process to generate benzylic radical and anion intermediates, enabling the synthesis of valuable indoline-3-carboxylic acids under mild conditions (room temperature, 1 atm CO2) with high chemo- and diastereoselectivity.",
